// Public EngineController mutation capability ledger for cloud V1.
// Keep one stable method name per row. Overloads share one classification.
//
// Audited BlockedV1 rows — these are deliberate, not gaps. Do not "unblock"
// one without reading the reason:
//   startRecording*/armCountIn*/tickCountIn — matches the server. Config sets
//     cloudRecordingEnabledV1 = false, the ops endpoint rejects
//     recording.commit, and the WS refuses recording leases. Unblocking the
//     client alone just moves the failure later. Needs a server flip first.
//   ensureInsertSlots/ensureMasterInsertSlots — they append *unloaded* slot
//     placeholders, which have no shared representation. No production caller
//     exists; only tests reach them.
//   setTrackInstrument — legacy name-only setter. The real path,
//     setTrackInstrumentPlugin, is SharedCommand.
//   undo/redo — the legacy local stack is blocked on purpose; a session routes
//     Edit > Undo to CollaborationCommandBridge::requestUndo(), which replays
//     an inverse command through the conditional-undo history instead.
VLT_MUTATION(attachSharedMutationSink, LocalOnly)
VLT_MUTATION(detachSharedMutationSink, LocalOnly)
VLT_MUTATION(attachSharedAssetMutationSink, LocalOnly)
VLT_MUTATION(detachSharedAssetMutationSink, LocalOnly)
VLT_MUTATION(completeSharedAssetMutation, SharedCommand)
VLT_MUTATION(cancelSharedAssetMutation, LocalOnly)
VLT_MUTATION(initialize, LocalOnly)
VLT_MUTATION(shutdown, LocalOnly)
